          <div class="fg"><label>Power Cuts / Day</label><input id="sc_cuts" type="number" placeholder="4" oninput="liveCalc()"/></div>
          <div class="fg"><label>Tariff Rate (₹/unit)</label><input id="sc_tariff" type="number" step="0.1" placeholder="6.5" oninput="liveCalc()"/></div>
          <div class="fg"><label>System Type</label><select id="sc_type" onchange="liveCalc()"><option value="offgrid">Offgrid</option><option value="hybrid">Hybrid</option></select></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-box" id="scResBox">
          <h4 style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:14px;">RESULTS</h4>
          <div id="scRes" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;">Enter details to calculate...</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-box" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div style="font-family:'Rajdhani',sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:10px;">⚡ WHY OFFGRID IS BEST FOR HIGH POWER CUT AREAS</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.85;">
          <p>🌞 <strong>Complete Independence:</strong> With offgrid + lithium batteries, your home or business has 100% power — no matter how many cuts per day. 6 cuts a day? Zero impact on you.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:8px;">🔋 <strong>LiFePO4 Lithium Battery:</strong> 6000+ charge cycles (15 years), 95% depth-of-discharge, zero maintenance — runs cool even in Chhattisgarh's 45°C summers.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:8px;">💰 <strong>₹0 Electricity Bill Forever:</strong> After the one-time investment, your electricity cost becomes zero. ROI in 4–6 years, then free energy for 20+ more years.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:8px;">🛡️ <strong>Proven in India:</strong> Offgrid solar is the most installed solution in rural and semi-urban India — reliable, government-supported and battle-tested.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- NOTIFICATIONS -->
    <div class="csec" id="sec-notifications">
      <div class="sec-hdr"><h2>🔔 <span>NOTIFICATIONS</span></h2></div>
      <div>
        <div class="notif-item"><div class="n-ico r">🔥</div><div><div class="n-ttl">New hot lead from AI bot — <strong>High power cut area detected</strong></div><div class="n-tm">Just now</div></div></div>
        <div class="notif-item"><div class="n-ico g">✅</div><div><div class="n-ttl">Lead converted — <strong>₹2.8L Hybrid System Rajendra Prasad Gupta</strong></div><div class="n-tm">2 hours ago</div></div></div>
        <div class="notif-item"><div class="n-ico a">📅</div><div><div class="n-ttl">Follow-up reminder: <strong>Sunita Devi</strong> — Site visit pending</div><div class="n-tm">Today 3:00 PM</div></div></div>
        <div class="notif-item"><div class="n-ico r">⚡</div><div><div class="n-ttl">AI Bot captured <strong>3 new leads overnight</strong></div><div class="n-tm">This morning</div></div></div>
        <div class="notif-item"><div class="n-ico g">💰</div><div><div class="n-ttl">Pipeline value crossed <strong>₹25 Lakh</strong> this month</div><div class="n-tm">Yesterday</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
